Explain a diagnostic code

Usage: specforge explain [OPTIONS] <CODE>

Arguments:
  <CODE>
          Diagnostic code (e.g., E001, W010), any case

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
